{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44742","headline":"同使君宿大梁驿 · 灵一","name":"同使君宿大梁驿","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"旌旗江上出，花外卷帘空。\n夜色临城月，春寒度水风。\n虽然行李别，且喜语音同。\n若问匡庐事，终身媿远公。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"灵一","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44742.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44742","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}